# Trivy ignore list — container & IaC scan exceptions (issue #206).
#
# Format: one CVE / misconfig id per line. Every entry MUST be preceded by a
# `# expires: YYYY-MM-DD` line (UTC). scripts/check-trivyignore-expiry.mjs fails
# the Container Scan workflow when an entry is past its expiry, forcing the
# quarterly review.
#
# Example:
#   # expires: 2026-11-30
#   # reason: base image maintainers have not shipped a fix; not network-exposed. Tracking: #1234
#   CVE-2025-00000
#
# (No active exceptions.)
